OL,3,GNEWSATrain disruption on several lines
OL,4,Aafter incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services through Hertfordshire
OL,7,Fhave suffered disruption after a minor
OL,8,Fcrash and cable thefts.
OL,10,FSignalling cables were stolen from
OL,11,FHitchin on Wednesday night, Network
OL,12,FRail said, which led to problems on the
OL,13,FGreat Northern, LNER and Thameslink
OL,14,Flines.
OL,16,FIn a separate incident, a train hit
OL,17,Fbuffers at Liverpool Street station,
OL,18,Fcausing delays on a number of lines out
OL,19,Fof London.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
