OL,3,GNEWSATrain disruption on several lines
OL,4,Aafter incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Anglia said the Stansted
OL,7,FExpress and trains to Hertford East
OL,8,Fwere affected, with some trains
OL,9,Fterminating at Bishop's Stortford and
OL,10,FStratford.
